            <exemplum xmlns:mods="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3" versionDate="2015-06-25" xml:lang="en">
              <p>In this example, the prefix <code>mods</code> is bound to the namespace
                  <code>http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3</code>.</p>
              <egXML xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/Examples" xml:id="gi-xenoData-egXML-gp"
                valid="feasible"><xenoData><mods:mods><mods:titleInfo><mods:title>Academic
